{'symbol': 'GPC', 'date': '2022-01-25 08:30:00', 'title': 'GENUINE PARTS COMPANY ANNOUNCES EXECUTIVE OFFICER CHANGES', 'text': 'ATLANTA, JAN. 25, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0GENUINE PARTS COMPANY (NYSE: GPC) ANNOUNCED TODAY\xa0THAT\xa0CAROL YANCEY, EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT AND CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER,\xa0HAS INFORMED THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF HER PLAN TO RETIRE AT THE END OF MAY 2022, AFTER A DISTINGUISHED 30-YEAR CAREER WITH THE COMPANY.\xa0THE COMPANY ALSO ANNOUNCED THAT BERT NAPPIER WILL JOIN AS EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT AND CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER-ELECT, EFFECTIVE FEBRUARY 28, 2022.'}